   <dc:title>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Miss your vacation this year? Would you like a chance to spend time with your family in the month of August? Short on time and cash? Relax. Stressed? This is the time to slow down. The rush to kill the unbelievable number of weeds in your lawn after the - 2</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
